# Conclude — Procedure

## Goal

```
Preserve unfinished obligations. External agents and runner automation never settle a standing agent; a standing procedure may self-settle when parked dormant with no pending work, and other threads use native settling, which applies when the current turn ends. A settled standing thread stays reachable and wakes in place on a message.
```

```
Hide the finished conversation through the runtime's closest non-destructive operation.
```

